LC_MS_ui_weapon_help_text:
Once decomposed, the Mothership will disappear and cannot be restored;
If you dismantle a developed Mothership, all items used for its development will be returned except for the Mothership EXP;
Decomposing Motherships will grant you the corresponding Mothership weapons. Each Mothership can only provide weapons during the first decomposition.
Some weapons can only be obtained through the Military Award Shop.
Even after the season ends, the obtained weapons will not disappear, but their levels will be reset.

LC_MS_building_recyclebin_help:
Once decomposed, the Mothership will disappear and cannot be restored; 
If you decompose a developed Mothership, you will Obtain 
 a certain amount of Weapon Essence; 
Automatically unequip weapons from slots 2 and 3, reset these weapons' levels to 1, and return 80% of the Weapon Essence used for weapon upgrades; 
Return all star level upgrade costs. 
Note: Decomposing Motherships in the Recycling Center will not receive it's weapons. To obtain the weapons, please go to the Mothership Warehouse to recovery weapons.
